     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;lucida grande&quot;,sans-serif\">(This was originally posted on Andrew&#39;s blog)</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;lucida grande&quot;,sans-serif\">As part of the upcoming <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/stan-conference-2017-registration-28292163623\" style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/stan-conference-2017-registration-28292163623&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459656708000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qhWGDnZXB-2le27ISnLsO\">StanCon 2017</a>, we will be teaching a number of classes on Bayesian inference and statistical modeling. Here is the lineup:</p><ol style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:14px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;lucida grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><li><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/introduction-to-bayesian-inference-with-stan-tickets-28642976915\" style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/introduction-to-bayesian-inference-with-stan-tickets-28642976915&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459656708000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WMHR1SOVJ7sB29MlyWswJ\">Introduction to Bayesian Inference with Stan</a> (2 days): 19 – 20 Jan 2017</li><li><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/stan-for-finance-and-econometrics-tickets-28643398175\" style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/stan-for-finance-and-econometrics-tickets-28643398175&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459656708000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Ymt9uJVZXEK_s5b61zCxP\">Stan for Finance and Econometrics</a> (1 day): 20 Jan 2017</li><li><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/stan-for-pharmacometrics-tickets-28643399178\" style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/stan-for-pharmacometrics-tickets-28643399178&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459656708000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NyeWvvtpydnTRMT6vql_W\">Stan for Pharmacometrics</a> (1 day): 20 Jan 2017</li><li><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/advanced-stan-programming-debugging-optimizing-tickets-28643400181\" style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/advanced-stan-programming-debugging-optimizing-tickets-28643400181&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459656708000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Hn9uy86ilV86yovlW8ZY6\">Advanced Stan: Programming, Debugging, Optimizing</a> (1 day): 20 Jan 2017</li></ol><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;lucida grande&quot;,sans-serif\">For Stan users and readers of this blog, please use the code “stanusers” to get a 10% discount.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;lucida grande&quot;,sans-serif\">We hope to see many of you online and in person.</p></div>\r\n"
